        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent alone is not enough to become a powerful cultivator. You'll need legendary artifacts, mystical abilities, powerful techniques, loyal spirit pets, and a touch of fate. Only by joining a mighty sect and becoming a true disciple can you begin to ascend the path to immortality!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/e532f8ded97e9c1646b45d5550beddfa.avif?t=1780207264\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras_big/e532f8ded97e9c1646b45d5550beddfa.avif?t=1780207264 width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper Realm: Path of the Immortal</strong> is a Roguelike survival strategy game set in a world of Eastern cultivation. classic roguelite growth systems, it combines thrilling gameplay with a unique paper-sculpted visual style. Characters and environments appear like 3D paper carvings, brought to life with shifting light and shadow to create a serene yet mystical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a cultivator striving to survive wave after wave of incoming beasts. Master divine arts, refine artifacts, practice powerful techniques, join sects, trigger random events, and tame spirit beasts — all in the name of survival and ascension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/ffc7111b6074dcaa66366e556819acf7.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/fae591965b064b7a15dd703c329d4acd.poster.avif?t=1780207264\" width=820 height=233 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/fae591965b064b7a15dd703c329d4acd.webm?t=1780207264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🕹️</strong>Got some downtime at work? Pop the game into windowed mode—one hand on your character, the other pretending to browse. Work and play, all in balance. Or after a long day, kick back with a cup of coffee and dive in. No tricky controls, just easy one-handed fun you can enjoy with friends or that special someone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/53b06edeb39a4fef3ef416ed73af9285.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/f45f32cb00580942449dc127062d0fcd.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1560 height=971 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌿</strong>Level up as you fight and gain EXP! In the world of cultivation, your journey goes through stages like <strong>Qi Refining</strong>, <strong>Foundation Building</strong>, <strong>Core Formation</strong>, <strong>Nascent Soul</strong>, and even higher realms. Each stage is split into early, mid, and late phases. Advancing a minor stage boosts your stats, while breaking through to a major stage lets you unlock new abilities in the talent tree.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/456565f2a71ff3d1ed96a9d2ba2ea428.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/b93ebdaaa27b620d520d7ca4082ebbd7.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=397 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌etween each enemy wave, you’ll enter the ‘<strong>Rest Realm</strong>.’ Take a breather, but don’t forget to spend your Spirit Essence to study new spells, forge powerful artifacts, master cultivation techniques, join sects, explore trials, or even tame spirit beasts—everything you need to prepare for the next monster onslaught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/64f64264740ab065e18b62743a4907c6.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/15d809b03a5c6db2b43d65a4ea2fdd09.avif?t=1780207264\" width=820 height=298 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏯</strong>Join the sect you like and grow stronger with its unique resources. Choose and master a cultivation technique to shape your own path and define a style that’s truly yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/10dcfc9eaa7c8eeddfb4369e51461506.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_