s_big/85737d31cb82b046c4274e251a2434cf.webp?t=1780207264 width=1560 height=772 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👤Whether you like to charge in headfirst as a tank, take hits with your own body, snipe enemies from afar, crunch the numbers to generate endless resources, or stay put and dish out damage as a caster-tank—there’s a character for every playstyle! Even more unique and fun-to-play characters are coming soon!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/3a90dbfabcff8bb4372d12b2082d39ac.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1406 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/12d7b9fc95d6299aeaaf136de98023b0.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1406 height=340 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭A huge variety of items awaits you! Frequent updates keep new content flowing like a tidal wave, making sure the fun never stops!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Plans</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Least 20 New Characters Added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell Fusion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Spirit Pets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More content and gameplay are on the way—add us to your wishlist and stay tuned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‘Journey Through the Paper Realm, Survive to Ascend’ — In this paper-crafted world of cultivation, fend off waves of monsters and push your limits!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent alone is not enough to become a powerful cultivator. You'll need legendary artifacts, mystical abilities, powerful techniques, loyal spirit pets, and a touch of fate. Only by joining a mighty sect and becoming a true disciple can you begin to ascend the path to immortality!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/e532f8ded97e9c1646b45d5550beddfa.avif?t=1780207264\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras_big/e532f8ded97e9c1646b45d5550beddfa.avif?t=1780207264 width=1600 height=916 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper Realm: Path of the Immortal</strong> is a Roguelike survival strategy game set in a world of Eastern cultivation. classic roguelite growth systems, it combines thrilling gameplay with a unique paper-sculpted visual style. Characters and environments appear like 3D paper carvings, brought to life with shifting light and shadow to create a serene yet mystical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a cultivator striving to survive wave after wave of incoming beasts. Master divine arts, refine artifacts, practice powerful techniques, join sects, trigger random events, and tame spirit beasts — all in the name of survival and ascension!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748740/extras/ffc7111b6074dcaa66366e556819acf7.avif?t=1780207264\" width=1080 height=113 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets